# Minimal placeholder for altunelyusuf/SemanticTechnologies@bad0fa7c46's
# landscape/02-ontology/semtech_tbox_v6_2_0.ttl (see this region's
# meta.json / context_predecl.py). This region's own two lines
# (`for s_, p_, d_ in en.NEW_RELATIONS: g2.add((IRI[s_], SEM[p_], IRI[d_]))`)
# only ADD triples to g2 -- they never read the graph's pre-existing
# triples -- so the real ~1000-triple tbox file's actual content cannot
# affect the triples written. A single triple stands in for it. The prefix
# declarations, however, are copied verbatim from the real file (lines
# 1-8): parsing them binds `semtech:` on g2, and the repository serialises
# g2 later (build_core_v6_3_0.py:207), so the region must not replace that
# binding.
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix semtech: <http://example.org/semtech#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

semtech:Ontology a owl:Ontology .
